			<div class="document__body">
				<p>Find me around the web</p>
				<ul>
					<li><a href="https://twitter.com/weimeng">Twitter</a></li>
					<li>
						<a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/weimeng/">LinkedIn</a>
					</li>
					<li><a href="https://github.com/weimeng">GitHub</a></li>
					<li><a href="https://gitlab.com/weimeng">GitLab</a></li>
					<li>
						<a href="https://www.goodreads.com/weimeng">Goodreads</a>
					</li>
				</ul>
				<p>
					This website is built with <a href="https://astro.build/">Astro</a>.
				</p>
			</div>
		</div>
	</div>
